---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="Coming Soon — SAN TUTOR E-Learning"
	titleEn="Coming Soon — SAN TUTOR E-Learning"
	description="Halaman materi E-Learning SAN TUTOR sedang disiapkan. Pilih Matematika yang sudah tersedia atau hubungi tim kami untuk request materi."
	descriptionEn="This SAN TUTOR E-Learning subject page is being prepared. Open the available Mathematics page or contact our team to request materials."
	currentPage="coming-soon"
>
	<main id="top">
		<section class="coming-hero">
			<div class="section-decor" aria-hidden="true">
				<span class="dot-grid dot-grid-hero"></span>
				<span class="blob blob-blue" style="top:-120px; left:-140px; width:340px; height:340px;"></span>
				<span class="blob blob-orange" style="bottom:-140px; right:-100px; width:280px; height:280px;"></span>
				<span class="blob blob-sage" style="top:38%; left:44%; width:240px; height:240px;"></span>
			</div>

			<div class="wrap coming-inner">
				<div class="coming-copy reveal">
					<p class="eyebrow">SAN TUTOR E-Learning</p>
					<h1><span data-subject-title>Materi ini</span> sedang kami siapkan.</h1>
					<p class="hero-lede">
						Kami sedang menyusun lesson library yang rapi, interaktif, dan siap dipakai di kelas maupun belajar mandiri di rumah. Untuk sementara, kamu bisa membuka halaman Matematika atau request materi melalui WhatsApp.
					</p>
					<div class="hero-cta coming-actions">
						<a href="/e-learning/matematika" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">Buka Matematika</a>
						<a href="/e-learning" class="btn btn-ghost btn-lg">Kembali ke E-Learning</a>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="coming-panel reveal" aria-label="Status materi E-Learning">
					<div class="panel-top">
						<span></span><span></span><span></span>
					</div>
					<div class="soon-badge">Coming Soon</div>
					<h2>Lesson sedang dibuat</h2>
					<p>Format yang disiapkan: slide interaktif, contoh soal, guided practice, independent practice, dan exit ticket.</p>
					<div class="progress-stack" aria-label="Progress persiapan materi">
						<div>
							<span>Lesson structure</span>
							<strong>Ready</strong>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span>Interactive slides</span>
							<strong>In progress</strong>
						</div>
						<div>
							<span>Worksheets & quiz</span>
							<strong>Next</strong>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="coming-map">
			<div class="wrap">
				<div class="section-head reveal">
					<p class="eyebrow">Learning Library</p>
					<h2>Mapel yang Akan Masuk ke E-Learning</h2>
					<p class="section-lede">Arah terbaiknya: semua mapel masuk dalam satu library, tetapi setiap mapel punya halaman khusus agar materi tidak bercampur.</p>
				</div>

				<div class="subject-grid reveal">
					<a href="/e-learning/matematika" class="subject-card is-ready">
						<span>01</span>
						<h3>Matematika</h3>
						<p>Lesson interaktif, latihan bertahap, dan soal konsep.</p>
						<strong>Sudah bisa dibuka →</strong>
					</a>
					<div class="subject-card">
						<span>02</span>
						<h3>English</h3>
						<p>Grammar, vocabulary, reading, writing, dan speaking prompts.</p>
						<strong>Segera hadir</strong>
					</div>
					<div class="subject-card">
						<span>03</span>
						<h3>Science</h3>
						<p>Concept slides, experiment ideas, diagram, dan quiz.</p>
						<strong>Segera hadir</strong>
					</div>
					<div class="subject-card">
						<span>04</span>
						<h3>Bahasa Indonesia</h3>
						<p>Teks, kaidah kebahasaan, pemahaman bacaan, dan menulis.</p>
						<strong>Segera hadir</strong>
					</div>
					<div class="subject-card">
						<span>05</span>
						<h3>STEM</h3>
						<p>Project-based learning, problem solving, dan design challenge.</p>
						<strong>Segera hadir</strong>
					</div>
					<div class="subject-card">
						<span>06</span>
						<h3>Coding</h3>
						<p>Scratch, block coding, logic, sequence, loop, dan condition.</p>
						<strong>Segera hadir</strong>
					</div>
					<div class="subject-card">
						<span>07</span>
						<h3>Robotic</h3>
						<p>Sensor, motor, algorithm, challenge, dan project reflection.</p>
						<strong>Segera hadir</strong>
					</div>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
	</main>

	<script>
		const subjectNames = {
			'english': { id: 'English', en: 'English' },
			'science': { id: 'Science', en: 'Science' },
			'bahasa-indonesia': { id: 'Bahasa Indonesia', en: 'Indonesian Language' },
			'stem': { id: 'STEM', en: 'STEM' },
			'coding': { id: 'Coding', en: 'Coding' },
			'robotic': { id: 'Robotic', en: 'Robotics' },
		};
		const subject = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('subject');
		const titleTarget = document.querySelector('[data-subject-title]');
		const updateSubjectTitle = (language = document.body.dataset.lang || 'id') => {
			if (titleTarget && subject && subjectNames[subject]) {
				titleTarget.textContent = language === 'en' ? subjectNames[subject].en : subjectNames[subject].id;
			}
		};
		updateSubjectTitle();
		window.addEventListener('santutor:language-change', (event) => updateSubjectTitle(event.detail?.language));
	</script>
</Layout>

<style>
	.coming-hero {
		position: relative;
		overflow: hidden;
		padding: 76px 0 96px;
		background: var(--white);
	}
	.coming-inner {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr 0.9fr;
		gap: 56px;
		align-items: center;
	}
	.coming-copy h1 {
		font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 4vw, 3.15rem);
		line-height: 1.14;
		letter-spacing: -0.005em;
		margin-bottom: 20px;
	}
	.coming-actions {
		margin-bottom: 0;
	}
	.coming-panel {
		position: relative;
		background: var(--white);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
		padding: 26px;
	}
	.panel-top {
		display: flex;
		gap: 7px;
		margin-bottom: 24px;
	}
	.panel-top span {
		width: 10px;
		height: 10px;
		border-radius: 50%;
		background: var(--border);
	}
	.soon-badge {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		padding: 7px 13px;
		border-radius: 100px;
		background: var(--orange-light);
		color: var(--orange);
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 900;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
		text-transform: uppercase;
		margin-bottom: 16px;
	}
	.coming-panel h2 {
		font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.5vw, 2rem);
		margin-bottom: 10px;
	}
	.progress-stack {
		display: grid;
		gap: 12px;
		margin-top: 24px;
	}
	.progress-stack div {
		display: flex;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 16px;
		padding: 14px 16px;
		border-radius: 16px;
		background: var(--cream);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
	}
	.progress-stack span {
		color: var(--ink-soft);
		font-weight: 800;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.progress-stack strong {
		color: var(--navy);
		font-size: 0.86rem;
	}
	.coming-map {
		position: relative;
		padding: 90px 0 100px;
		background: var(--cream);
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.subject-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
		gap: 20px;
	}
	.subject-card {
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 10px;
		background: var(--white);
		border: 1px solid var(--border);
		border-radius: var(--radius-md);
		padding: 24px;
		min-height: 220px;
		transition: transform 0.22s ease, box-shadow 0.22s ease, border-color 0.22s ease;
	}
	.subject-card:hover {
		transform: translateY(-5px);
		box-shadow: var(--shadow-soft);
	}
	.subject-card span {
		font-family: var(--font-display);
		font-weight: 700;
		color: var(--blue);
		font-size: 0.88rem;
	}
	.subject-card h3 {
		font-size: 1.25rem;
	}
	.subject-card p {
		font-size: 0.92rem;
		flex: 1;
	}
	.subject-card strong {
		color: var(--orange);
		font-size: 0.9rem;
	}
	.subject-card.is-ready {
		border-color: rgba(242, 118, 30, 0.28);
		background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--white), var(--orange-light));
	}
	@media (max-width: 980px) {
		.coming-inner,
		.subject-grid {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}
		.coming-copy {
			text-align: center;
		}
		.coming-copy .hero-lede {
			margin-inline: auto;
		}
		.coming-actions {
			justify-content: center;
		}
	}
	@media (max-width: 560px) {
		.coming-hero {
			padding-top: 48px;
		}
		.coming-actions {
			flex-direction: column;
		}
		.coming-actions .btn {
			width: 100%;
		}
		.coming-panel {
			padding: 22px;
		}
		.progress-stack div {
			align-items: flex-start;
			flex-direction: column;
			gap: 4px;
		}
	}
</style>
